        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Koh Samui in August is the right time, right place for so many reasons. Early riser? You’ll love Samui’s long August days. If you’ve never seen a sunrise in your life and prefer to sleep in, can we all agree on happy hour? Between sunrise and sunset, you’ll find that Samui in August perfectly accommodates any itinerary you’ve got in mind. Shall we make some plans?",
