        "h_title": "1. 100% Linen Shirt",
        "main_title": "We send REALLY USEFUL emails",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 5,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "A long-sleeved linen shirt: August is a very sunny month and Thailand’s sun means mega business. For further sun protection, make sure to pack plenty of SPF 30+ sunscreen (or higher), a wide-brimmed hat and a range of beach/pool cover-ups. Don't forget neck and back-of-knee-protection for the beach and pool.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
