            "text": "This is a very clever piece of packing. It’s a backpack when you need it, and no extra weight when you don’t. We’ve all seen ‘make it tiny’ bags before – but this one has the quality of a normal bag, with superb durability. Its side-pocket for an 18 oz water bottle is doubly appreciated once Thailand’s sun kicks in.",
