          {
            "text": "The Koh Samui Guide : With a weather-proof vacation plan and The Koh Samui Guide in your pocket, you can look forward to days of fantastic, relaxing things (Thai massages are just the start). Make sure to brag and brag loudly about your August holiday plans. It’s a great time of year to visit Samui, and those left behind need to be made jealous.",
